# Agent Instructions

> **All rules for this repository live in [`CLAUDE.md`](./CLAUDE.md). Read it in full before doing
> any work here, and follow every rule in it.** This file exists only to point at it.

**No hooks are configured for Cursor** — apply every hook-delivered rule yourself, per `prompts/collaboration-workflow/principles.md` → "Claude Code 以外のエージェントでの読み替え". Do not copy rules back into this file.

## Svelte MCP

For Svelte 5 / SvelteKit work, use the Svelte MCP server: call `list-sections` first, then `get-documentation` for every section whose use_cases match the task, and run `svelte-autofixer` on any Svelte code you write until it reports nothing. Offer `playground-link` only when asked, and never for code written to project files.
